              "signal": "N2 volume production on track for H2 2025; N2 tape-out count in first two years already exceeds N3 and N5 in same period. N2 vs N3E: 10-15% speed improvement, 25-30% power improvement, 15%+ density increase. N2P (extension of N2) scheduled H2 2026. A16 (featuring super power rail) also H2 2026; A16 vs N2P: 8-10% speed, 15-20% power, 7-10% density gains.",
              "figure": "N2 HVM H2 2025; N2P and A16 HVM H2 2026"
            },
